## Executive Summary
Over the past 12 months, the CFO invested $2M research budget into the `com.dev.photoeditor` app, yet its overall performance score dropped from 85 to 72. This analysis reveals that the decline is primarily driven by deteriorating performance in high-revenue mature markets (North America, Europe, and Asia), where crash rates have doubled, quality scores have fallen, and revenue has declined sharply. In contrast, low-revenue emerging markets (South America) show growth, but their small revenue share cannot offset losses. The app’s version fragmentation increased from 12 to 23, directly impacting stability and user retention in demanding high-value regions.

## 1. Overall Performance Deterioration (Global View)
