  - Daily Net Revenue: $285K → $146K (-48.8%)
  - Daily Churn Rate: 0.32 → 0.65 (+103%)
  - Crash Rate (per 1k devices): 1.0 → 3.2 (+220%)
  - Version Fragmentation: 12 → 23 (+92%)

The drop accelerated through the year, stabilizing at 72 after August, coinciding with Europe’s revenue falling to zero after February and North America’s revenue declining by 58%.

## 2. Regional Revenue Contribution & Change (Jan‑Dec 2024)
