- **Metrics available per interaction:**
  - `open_rate` = opened / received emails
  - `click_rate` = clicked / received emails
  - `click‑to‑open` = clicked / opened emails
  - `active_retention_rate_week` (weekly retention)
  - `active_retention_rate_month` (monthly retention)

