    f.write('- **Discount‑related subject lines** outperformed product‑launch and unknown themes on both open rate (49.1% vs 46.2% vs 34.4%) and click rate (18.3% vs 15.4% vs 10.9%), while also achieving perfect retention (100% weekly and monthly).\n')
    f.write('- **Weekday vs weekend** differences were minimal (open rates 44.7% vs 44.6%), but the single weekend touchpoint delivered perfect retention.\n')
