    f.write('\n\n**Insights:**\n')
    f.write('- Discount‑related emails achieve the highest open and click rates, suggesting that promotional language (“seasonal offers”) resonates more with recipients.\n')
    f.write('- Both discount‑related touchpoints show perfect retention (100% weekly and monthly), while the other themes have retention rates around 90%.\n')
    f.write('- Even with tiny sample sizes, the pattern suggests that discount‑based messaging may support better long‑term customer activity.\n\n')

    f.write('---\n\n')
