1. Aggregate conversion rates by job role (like Frontend, Backend, Data, DevOps, QA, Machine Learning, Full Stack) and month.
2. Plot line chart for each role over months, showing conversion rate trend.
3. Also plot bar chart for overall Engineering vs Marketing.

