# Stage2: Visual Evidence

## 1. Departmental Conversion Trend
![Engineering vs Marketing conversion rate trend](dept_trend.png)

The line chart depicts the monthly application-to-interview conversion rates for Engineering and Marketing departments over the last six months. It clearly shows Engineering’s conversion rate declining from ~35% to ~22% while Marketing remained stable above 45%, reinforcing the primary finding that Engineering has experienced a pronounced drop.

## 2. Engineering Roles Performance
